    "body": "## What\n\nAdds `api/claimline/remittance.py`:\n\n- post remittance batches to the payment gateway\n- load payer remittance config\n- parse amounts from raw payer fields\n- validate/price/post a batch and return a receipt\n- write 835 remittance files\n- reverse a payment when a claim is later denied\n\n## Testing\n\nExisting suites pass; ruff run locally.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_019FtoBbsrGyBxSLTdgLe7tR)_",
